(c) on a label referred to in Article 16;
(d) in a user manual or other documentation accompanying the product;
(e) on a free access website or application. Information that makes it possible to track substances of concern pursuant to paragraph 5 shall be given either on the product or be accessible through a data carrier included on the product.

